# textdomain: dw_nodes
# Punjabi translation of DoggioWars. English is the source language.

Stone=ਪੱਥਰ
Desert Stone=ਮਾਰੂਥਲ ਪੱਥਰ
Sandstone=ਰੇਤਲਾ ਪੱਥਰ
